OL,3,GNEWSACouncil confident #68m flood
OL,4,Ascheme is on firm legal ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it is confident of
OL,7,Fits legal position after concerns were
OL,8,Fraised about land being used for a #68m
OL,9,Fflood protection scheme.
OL,11,FDumfries and Galloway Council (DGC)
OL,12,Fsaid it wanted to "set out the facts"
OL,13,Fabout the use of common good land -
OL,14,Fowned by the local authority for the
OL,15,Fbenefit of the community - as part of
OL,16,Fthe project.
OL,18,FIt comes after calls for greater
OL,19,Ftransparency after it was found to have
OL,20,F"failed at the most basic level" in its
OL,21,Fresponse to freedom of information
OL,22,F(FOI) requests about the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
