OL,3,GNEWSACouncil confident #68m flood
OL,4,Ascheme is on firm legal ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it had taken legal
OL,7,Fadvice and was confident that tackling
OL,8,Fthe flood risk in the area was
OL,9,F"consistent with its duty to protect
OL,10,Fand advance the common good".
